#
# The revision of the EHDS system documents a FerroEHR release relies on.
#
# The EHR system Cadasto B.V. declares is FerroEHR with FerroBRIDGE, and its
# information sheet (EHDS Art. 38), instructions for use (Art. 30(1)(d)),
# readiness record and technical documentation (Art. 37, Annex III) live in
# the FerroHEALTH book, website/book/src/ehds/ of FerroHEALTH/FerroHEALTH.
# Each page there carries "Revised YYYY-MM-DD." on its third line. This file
# names the commit of that repository a release takes the pages from and the
# revision date of each page at that commit:
#
#   - scripts/release/accompanying-documents.sh fetches the information sheet
#     and the instructions for use at FERROHEALTH_COMMIT and refuses a page
#     whose Revised line differs from its date here;
#   - scripts/checks/release-notes.sh refuses notes that do not name these
#     revisions;
#   - scripts/checks/technical-documentation.sh --since refuses a release that
#     changes the logging component without moving this file or FerroEHR's
#     own technical documentation (EHDS Art. 30(2)).
#
# Move the pin by setting the commit and the four dates together, read from
# the pages at that commit. No specification governs this file: our own
# design.
FERROHEALTH_COMMIT=f3b5d761d7be5f039676a3c1bc8d03898fc3efa0
INFORMATION_SHEET_REVISED=2026-10-26
INSTRUCTIONS_FOR_USE_REVISED=2026-10-26
READINESS_REVISED=2026-10-26
TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION_REVISED=2026-10-26
